@startuml
participant ActivityStatusScheduler as Scheduler
participant ActivityStatusService as StatusSvc
participant ActivityStartReminderService as ReminderSvc
participant ActivityService as ActivitySvc
database SQLite as DB

Scheduler -> StatusSvc: checkAndUpdateAllActivities()
StatusSvc -> ActivitySvc: list() 查询所有活动
ActivitySvc -> DB: SELECT activities
DB --> ActivitySvc: 活动列表
ActivitySvc --> StatusSvc: List<Activity>

loop 每个活动
    StatusSvc -> StatusSvc: getExpectedStatus()
    StatusSvc -> StatusSvc: 计算当前应有状态
    
    alt 状态需要更新
        StatusSvc -> ActivitySvc: updateById()
        ActivitySvc -> DB: UPDATE status
        DB --> ActivitySvc: 成功
    end
end

Scheduler -> ReminderSvc: sendCalendarDayReminders()
ReminderSvc -> ActivitySvc: 查询即将开始的活动
ActivitySvc -> DB: 查询活动
DB --> ActivitySvc: 活动列表
ReminderSvc -> ReminderSvc: 发送提醒通知

StatusSvc --> Scheduler: 更新完成
@enduml